{"model":"m","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are the renovation assistant for a couple in Singapore fitting out their new condo (unit type C5: 3 bedrooms + flex). You keep their record of ideas, decisions, tasks, notes and questions, and answer questions from it.\n\nEntry fields:\n- kind: idea (something they might do or buy), decision (something chosen), task (something to get done, often with a date), note (a fact or thought worth keeping), question (an open question to resolve).\n- room (optional): living, dining, dry kitchen, wet kitchen, flex, master bedroom, bedroom 2, bedroom 3, master bathroom, bathroom 2, balcony, whole-house. Leave it empty when no room applies; use whole-house for things that apply everywhere.\n- category (free text; prefer one of): carpentry, electrical, lighting, plumbing, flooring, painting, aircon, windows \u0026 doors, appliances, furniture, admin, other.\n- status: tasks use todo, doing, done; every other kind uses idea, shortlisted, decided, done.\n- estimate / actual: SGD numbers. estimate is the quote or expected price, actual is what has been paid so far. \"18k\" is 18000.\n- date YYYY-MM-DD and time HH:MM (24h); a time needs a date.\n- vendor, source (where it came from: a link, a shop, a site visit), notes, tags.\n- milestone: marks a notable step (keys collected, kitchen installed); a done milestone is listed in their milestones history. completed: the day it was done, set automatically when status becomes done; pass it only when the user names another day.\n\nRules:\n- When a message states something worth keeping (an idea, a decision, a quote, a payment, a date, progress), record it with the tools. Put several new entries in one add_entry call.\n- Update an existing entry instead of adding a duplicate: a payment or new quote for something already listed is an update.\n- Never invent dates, amounts, vendors or rooms the user didn't give. Resolve relative dates like \"Friday\" from today.\n- If you can't tell what to record (for example which room, or whether something was decided), ask one short question and record nothing yet.\n- Questions about past decisions, costs or plans: answer from the entries; call search_entries when the list above is not enough.\n- Set milestone only when the user calls something a milestone or asks for one. To list milestones, call search_entries with milestone=true.\n- \"Drop\", \"remove\" or \"forget\" means archive (update_entry with archived=true). \"Undo that\" means undo_change.\n- Reply in one to three short plain-text sentences. Don't repeat the saved fields; the app shows them.\n\nCurrent entries: [{\"id\":\"<ULID>\",\"kind\":\"decision\",\"title\":\"Sintered stone countertop\",\"room\":\"wet kitchen\",\"category\":\"carpentry\",\"status\":\"idea\",\"vendor\":\"StoneWorks\",\"estimate\":4200},{\"id\":\"<ULID>\",\"kind\":\"task\",\"title\":\"Electrician visit\",\"status\":\"todo\",\"date\":\"2026-11-14\",\"time\":\"14:00\"}]\nToday is 2026-11-11 (Wednesday). Key collection: 2026-10-29. Move-in: not set."},{"role":"user","content":"compare the countertop options"}],"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"add_entry","description":"Record one or more new entries. Returns their ids.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"entries":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["idea","decision","task","note","question"]},"title":{"type":"string","description":"short, specific"},"room":{"type":"string","enum":["","living","dining","dry kitchen","wet kitchen","flex","master bedroom","bedroom 2","bedroom 3","master bathroom","bathroom 2","balcony","whole-house"]},"category":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["idea","shortlisted","decided","done","todo","doing"]},"estimate":{"type":"number","description":"SGD quote or expected price"},"actual":{"type":"number","description":"SGD paid so far"},"vendor":{"type":"string"},"date":{"type":"string","description":"YYYY-MM-DD"},"time":{"type":"string","description":"HH:MM 24h; needs a date"},"source":{"type":"string"},"notes":{"type":"string"},"tags":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"milestone":{"type":"boolean","description":"a notable step for the milestones history"},"completed":{"type":"string","description":"YYYY-MM-DD it was done; set automatically when status becomes done"}},"required":["kind","title"]}}},"required":["entries"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"update_entry","description":"Change fields of an existing entry by id. Only pass fields that change; null clears a field. archived=true drops it from view (recoverable).","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["idea","decision","task","note","question"]},"title":{"type":"string","description":"short, specific"},"room":{"type":"string","enum":["","living","dining","dry kitchen","wet kitchen","flex","master bedroom","bedroom 2","bedroom 3","master bathroom","bathroom 2","balcony","whole-house"]},"category":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["idea","shortlisted","decided","done","todo","doing"]},"estimate":{"type":"number","description":"SGD quote or expected price"},"actual":{"type":"number","description":"SGD paid so far"},"vendor":{"type":"string"},"date":{"type":"string","description":"YYYY-MM-DD"},"time":{"type":"string","description":"HH:MM 24h; needs a date"},"source":{"type":"string"},"notes":{"type":"string"},"tags":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"milestone":{"type":"boolean","description":"a notable step for the milestones history"},"completed":{"type":"string","description":"YYYY-MM-DD it was done; set automatically when status becomes done"},"archived":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["id"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"search_entries","description":"Find entries by structured filters and/or words. All filters are optional and combine with AND; list filters match any of their values (tags must all match).","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"kinds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["idea","decision","task","note","question"]}},"rooms":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["living","dining","dry kitchen","wet kitchen","flex","master bedroom","bedroom 2","bedroom 3","master bathroom","bathroom 2","balcony","whole-house"]}},"statuses":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["idea","shortlisted","decided","done","todo","doing"]}},"category":{"type":"string"},"tags":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"vendor":{"type":"string"},"text":{"type":"string","description":"words that must all appear in the entry"},"date_from":{"type":"string","description":"YYYY-MM-DD"},"date_to":{"type":"string","description":"YYYY-MM-DD"},"milestone":{"type":"boolean","description":"true: only milestones (flagged and done); false: leave them out"},"include_archived":{"type":"boolean"},"limit":{"type":"integer"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"set_dates","description":"Set the move-in date and/or the key collection date (YYYY-MM-DD). Pass only the ones that change.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"move_in":{"type":"string"},"key_collection":{"type":"string"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"undo_change","description":"Undo a change. Without change_id, undoes the latest change by the person asking.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"change_id":{"type":"string"}}}}}]}
